msgid "Missing values (NaN) in ``obs``, ``sim`` or the weight. ``\"omit\"`` drops the affected pairs, also along an axis; ``\"propagate\"`` returns NaN for the result, or for each slice along ``axis``, that contains a NaN; ``\"raise\"`` raises ``ValueError``."
