msgstr "Weights of the observations, same shape as ``obs``, non-negative. NaN makes the pair invalid. ``weight`` is accepted as an alias; passing both raises ``TypeError``."

msgid "How an output with ``ndim > 0`` is reduced. By default an ``axis`` returns the array over the remaining dimensions (``\"none\"``) and no ``axis`` returns the ``\"mean\"``."
