msgid "Labelled inputs. ``\"strict\"`` raises ``ValueError`` if the indexes of two pandas objects (or the coordinates of two xarray objects) differ; ``\"inner\"`` cuts them to the common labels, in the order of ``obs``, before the NaN policy is applied. Inputs without labels are matched by position; ``\"inner\"`` raises ``ValueError`` for them."
