msgstr "Not supported by this metric: any other value raises ``NotImplementedError``."

msgid "*float or np.ndarray* -- With ``reduction=\"mean\"``, the fraction of verified forecasts. With ``reduction=\"none\"``, an array of 1.0 (verified), 0.0 (not verified) and NaN where the error is missing or its group has fewer than two valid errors."
msgstr "*float or np.ndarray* -- With ``reduction=\"mean\"``, the fraction of verified forecasts. With ``reduction=\"none\"``, an array of 1.0 (verified), 0.0 (not verified) and NaN where the error is missing or its group has fewer than two valid errors."

