msgstr "hydrometrics.weighted\\_crps"

msgid "Weighted Continuous Ranked Probability Score (Weighted CRPS)."
msgstr "Weighted Continuous Ranked Probability Score (Weighted CRPS)."

msgid "The classical CRPS of every observation is averaged with the weights ``weight_func(obs) * weight``. This weights observations, not the integrand of the CRPS as Gneiting & Ranjan (2011) do for threshold- and quantile-weighted scores."
msgstr "The classical CRPS of every observation is averaged with the weights ``weight_func(obs) * weight``. This weights observations, not the integrand of the CRPS as Gneiting & Ranjan (2011) do for threshold- and quantile-weighted scores."

msgid "Forecast values: same shape as ``obs`` (deterministic) or ``obs.shape + (n_members,)`` (ensemble)."
msgstr "Forecast values: same shape as ``obs`` (deterministic) or ``obs.shape + (n_members,)`` (ensemble)."

msgid "Weight function w(y) applied to observations. Default: uniform weight (standard CRPS). Examples: lambda y: 1/y for emphasizing low flows, lambda y: y for emphasizing high flows."
msgstr "Weight function w(y) applied to observations. Default: uniform weight (standard CRPS). Examples: lambda y: 1/y for emphasizing low flows, lambda y: y for emphasizing high flows."

